// The family's shared Markdown ruleset, which lives in Common-Automation
// so one file states the bar for every repo. The rules and the reasoning
// are there; this file only points at them.
//
// The path assumes Common-Automation is checked out beside this repo, as
// the Gradle build and the pre-commit hook already do. Without that
// checkout the editor reports a missing config rather than linting
// against the wrong rules, which is the failure worth having.
{
    "extends": "../Common-Automation/.markdownlint.jsonc"
}
